            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché l'elemento <code>li</code> è un discendente dell'elemento <code>body</code>?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  Inventory\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"ul\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Health Potion\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"ul\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Poiché <code>li</code> è collegato a <code>body</code> tramite l'annidamento, anche se tra i due sono presenti altri nodi come <code>ul</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Poiché l'elemento <code>body</code> contiene sempre un elemento <code>li</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Poiché <code>li</code> è collegato a <code>body</code> tramite l'annidamento, anche se tra i due sono presenti altri nodi come <code>ul</code>.</p></body></html>"
